        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n15 Bayview Drive, Wexford Town\n\nTucked away in this mature and highly sought-after residential development, 15 Bayview Drive presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained three-bedroom home in a location that combines everyday convenience with genuine potential.\n\nFrom the moment you step through the entrance porch, there is an immediate sense of space and light. The accommodation is bright and welcoming, with good-sized windows throughout allowing natural light to flow through the home. The open-plan reception and dining area provides a comfortable space for both everyday living and entertaining, with warm timber flooring and a feature brick fireplace adding character and charm.\n\nThe kitchen is practical and well-appointed, with ample fitted cabinetry, tiled splashbacks and a good range of appliances. To the rear, the property enjoys a pleasant garden, while the front provides private resident parking.\n\nUpstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom, offering excellent accommodation for a growing family, first-time buyer or those looking for a manageable permanent home. \n\nOne of the property's most appealing features is the versatility it offers for the future. The existing garage presents an exciting opportunity, subject to the necessary planning permissions, to create additional accommodation such as a home office, second reception room, playroom or potentially a downstairs bedroom. The generous space beneath the stairs also provides valuable additional storage or scope for an alternative use.\n\nImportantly, this is a home that is ready to move into. The property has been newly painted and thoroughly cleaned, meaning there is no immediate work required on moving day. At the same time, it provides the opportunity for its new owners to introduce their own style and, over time, make improvements or additions that could transform an already comfortable home into something truly personal.\n\nThe location is difficult to overlook. Bayview Drive is within walking distance of Wexford town centre and is ideally positioned for access to a wide range of amenities including shops, schools, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and everyday services. Public transport is also readily accessible, with Wexford Bus and Bus Éireann services nearby, together with Wexford railway station and the Wexford Local Link. The property's position also provides convenient access to the main routes serving Dublin, Waterford and Cork.\n\nWhether you are searching for a permanent family home, a first home, a property to downsize to or an investment opportunity, 15 Bayview Drive deserves serious consideration.\n\nThere is something particularly appealing about finding a second-hand home that requires nothing immediately, yet leaves you with the freedom to make it your own. \n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.97m x 1.94m\nSpacious entrance hall, storage space under staircase.\n\nReception Room - 3.99m x 3.45m\nGood size reception room that flows into the dining room creating space and movement.\n\nDining Room - 3.78m x 3.62m\nLovely deep red brick open fireplace with stove.\n\nKitchen - 3.78m x 2.32m\nFully fitted kitchen, view to rear garden.\n\nLanding - 2.74m x 1.86m\n\n\nBedroom 1. - 4.07m x 2.71m\nNicely proportionate first bedroom with lovely large framed windows allowing the sunlight fill the room, carpet to floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.58m x 1.75m\nw.c , w.h.b , shower & bath, fitted cabinets, tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2. - 4.07m x 3.99m\nAnother lovely second bedroom engulfed in natural light, carpet to floor.\n\nBedroom 3. - 2.75m x 2.68m\n\n\n"
      },
